  <!-- EN: archist -->
  <Structure_Archist.label>arqueiro</Structure_Archist.label>
  <!-- EN: Archotechs are the true gods. They know the moral structure of the universe, and serving them is how we will connect with it. -->
  <Structure_Archist.description>Archotechs são os verdadeiros deuses. Eles sabem que a estrutura moral do universo, e servi-los é como nós nos conectaremos com ele.</Structure_Archist.description>
